              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "matgurl"
            },
            "reviewBody": "this was exactly what i wanted, very tasty...i wanted kind of a simple nicoise salad type tuna salad and this was it. after tasting the initial combination with only 1 tblspn of olive oil, i did add garbanzo beans for fiber. eaten with low-fat triscuits made for a very nutritious, low-cal, low-fat light lunch/snack."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
